# serve/ holds COPIES of the canonical scripts one level up (Deploy/pilot/*.ps1), staged so the
# box can curl them off the tunnel. Deliberately NOT tracked: a second tracked copy is free to
# drift from the canonical one, and a stale copy of Deploy-OnBox.ps1 sitting in an old serve
# folder is exactly what deployed alpha-8 over alpha-10 on 2026-07-18. One source of truth.
Deploy-OnBox.ps1
Start-Server-OnBox.ps1
Start-Fleet-OnBox.ps1
